        "id": "ch5_5_1-1",
        "text": "CrewAI example\nLet\u2019s examine how CrewAI implements tool-based reasoning through a practical travel planning\nexample. The framework\u2019s Python library provides a @tool decorator that allows us to define tools\nwith clear descriptions and documentation. Here\u2019s how we can create a set of travel-related tools:\n1 @tool (\"Search for available flights between cities\")\n2 def search_flights(...) -> dict:\n3IIII\"\"\"Search for available flights between cities.\"\"\"\n4IIII# Call flight API and other tool logic\n5\n6 @tool (\"Find available hotels in a location\")\n7 def find_hotels(...) -> dict:\n8III\"\"\"Search for available hotels in a location.\"\"\"\n9III# Call hotels API and other tool logic\n10\n11 @tool (\"Find available activities in a location\")\n12 def find_activities(...) -> dict:\n13III\"\"\"Find available activities in a location.\"\"\"\n14II# Call activities API and other tool logic\nThe tools are then assigned to an agent that understands how to use them in context. The agent is\ncreated with a specific role, goal, and backstory that helps guide its decision-making:\n1 Agent(\n2IIIIrole='An expert travel concierge',\n3IIIIgoal='Handle all aspects of travel planning',\n4IIIIbackstory=\"Expert in airline bookings and flight\nlogistics, hotel bookings, and booking vacation\nEnabling Tool Use and Planning in Agents\n130\nactivities.\",\n5IIIItools=[search_flights, find_hotels, find_activities],\n6IIIIverbose=False\n7 )\nWhen given a task, the agent uses these tools based on the context and requirements:\n1 travel_planning_task = Task(\n2IIIIdescription=f\"\"\"\n3IIIIPlan a comprehensive travel and leisure itinerary\n4IIIIbased on the following request:\n5IIII{request}\n6IIIIThe plan should include:\n7IIII- Flight arrangements\n8IIII- Accommodation bookings\n9IIII- Any other relevant travel components\n10III\"\"\",\n11IIIexpected_output=\"A detailed travel itinerary covering\nall requested aspects.\",\n12IIIagent=self.travel_specialist )",
